acceptance_criteria: "Patch external Axios to a cooldown-eligible supported release and eliminate affected CJS/ESM bundled copies with reproducible integrity and source-map evidence.; Preserve CodSpeed instrumentation, platform compatibility, benchmark coverage and package contracts; retain genuine pre-fix vulnerability controls.; Enforce development dependency vulnerability admission in mandatory CI, nightly, release and local gates; seeded vulnerable artifacts must fail without changing coverage or quality thresholds.; Verify full and production audits, dev-inclusive Trivy, real Node/Bun tooling and merged-main Scorecard retirement; document evidence tiers without suppressing or dismissing an unresolved report."
