expected_result: No vulnerable external or embedded Axios remains reachable from installed development tooling; dev-inclusive gates refuse reintroduction while production SDK and CodSpeed benchmark contracts remain compatible.
actual_result: All-dependency audit currently fails with seven high and five moderate advisories; production audit passes. Scorecard alert 29 remains open on main. Embedded Axios copies and dev-scan admission need independent remediation.
